# Testing

## Tools

- Unit/component: Vitest + Testing Library
- E2E: Playwright
- API mocks: MSW handlers generated from OpenAPI
- A11y: axe in Playwright

## Per page (minimum)

1. Happy path (load + primary action)
2. Permission denied (control hidden or disabled; direct URL blocked)
3. Out-of-scope / unknown id → not-available page
4. Axe scan with no serious/critical violations

## Per feature logic

- Zod schemas: valid + invalid fixtures
- `mapError()` branches for codes used by the feature
- Money helpers: string decimal ↔ minor units round-trip
- Offline outbox: enqueue, sync applied/conflict (staff features only)

## Conventions

- Colocate unit tests next to the module or under `features/<name>/__tests__/`
- E2E under `e2e/` grouped by side (`e2e/admin/students.spec.ts`)
- Prefer role/name queries; avoid brittle CSS selectors
- Never assert on role names — assert on permissions or visible labels from fixtures
